            </note>
            <note corresp="#d16-f2" n="1a" xml:id="d16-f2-content">
                <p>Alfredo Baldomir.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d16-f3" n="2" xml:id="d16-f3-content">
                <p>José Gervasio Artigas, founder of the independence of Uruguay, was born in
                    Montevideo, June 19, 1764.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d16-f4" n="3" xml:id="d16-f4-content">
                <p>See undated telegram from the Minister in Uruguay, <ref
                        target="frus1917Supp01v01#pg_301"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1917, supp. 1, p. 301</ref>.</p>
            </note>
